{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "7474ce91649e24167eb2038990df2bd180e2e299ede57c53b6bbbc39de811834", "ja": "エミリーの場合：大好きなもの", "zh": "艾米莉的情况：最喜欢的事物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "815535f0409a950c75d7218be9cff75ec4de8a40a3ffdd6c70c747220b0a3812", "ja": "撮影のための着物を選ぶエミリー。女将に\n却下され続けるが、落ち込んだ様子はない。\n外国人である自分のままで日本を愛している\nエミリーは素直に自分の外見に似合う着物を\n教えてもらい、見事な一枚を撮る。", "zh": "为了拍摄而挑选和服的艾米莉。虽然不断被女将否决，但她并没有显得消沉。作为外国人的她依然热爱日本，也坦率地请女将教自己选择适合外貌的和服，最终拍下了一张精彩的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "98a84c5c6456b83ebf5dbf74bff61c9259385aa88a46e891c9c748c11a9ebe18", "ja": "（エミリーはやはり和を取り入れたいとのことで、\n浅草にある呉服屋にやってきた）", "zh": "（艾米莉果然还是想融入和风，于是我们来到了浅草的一家和服店）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ff39e133274b2ca31c13e9518c3d5a8ced7ebb45e3243893570bd2035fa28971", "ja": "（ここで着物を見繕ってもらって、\n撮影に挑む予定なんだけど……）", "zh": "（打算在这里请人帮忙挑选和服，然后去参加拍摄，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "f71cc92f478b1d3c39945fdca135b883b775ab2e03529d4d2cfa7d97a726b025", "ja": "あの、ではこういう色合いのものは……？\n裏地も素敵で……。", "zh": "那个，那么这种色调的如何呢……？\n里衬也很好看……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1003_okamisan", "source_sha256": "70a063e34a8333e39a249b3a5ac5781847534d1be5193a0136407e0cb3bac3e4", "ja": "あー、そりゃこの時期のもんじゃないよ！\nほら、季節が合ってないだろ？", "zh": "啊——那可不是这个季节的东西哦！\n你看，季节根本对不上吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1004_okamisan", "source_sha256": "203867d505f7a90682918eced4925c81bce1d81ad31555f33accfc05714111ce", "ja": "それと、八掛にこだわって玄人ぶるのは百年早いって\nもんさ！　柄と帯の組み合わせをちゃんと考えてから！", "zh": "而且，光在八挂上下功夫装老练，还早着一百年呢！先好好考虑花纹和腰带的搭配再说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "b7ab039e7344c344d0ef8a9d30f1698c96fb81065c5f60902ced6e86730d0d0a", "ja": "う、すみません……。\n憧れがあって、つい……。", "zh": "呃，对不起……  \n因为心里憧憬着，不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "a02096a19a9a855264475e7177824a905eda5eaf7401ca359c19a2c3656cd601", "ja": "あの、ではこれは……？", "zh": "那个，那么这个呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1007_okamisan", "source_sha256": "61d8c1bed01e4bfed54f084404264066fab5883bf1c036f49e8ba18c6c3280a0", "ja": "銘仙ね。悪くないけど、その柄だと金髪が品なく\n見えるじゃないか。アンタには似合わないねぇ。", "zh": "銘仙啊。是不差，可是配上那个花纹，金发看起来就显得俗气了。你可不适合呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1009_okamisan", "source_sha256": "e0f518fa27f42fa5c5600940c636ee095b1ae68669a2bece8b98da4551a39754", "ja": "……まったく。せっかくうちに来といて、\n困ったもんさね。ちょいとごめんよ！", "zh": "……真是的。难得都到我这儿来了，真让人伤脑筋。不好意思，借过一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1010_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ce665adfea161590f4a9e875f40e0d101a23f4eca0387bef47c419b1e102c0f7", "ja": "（言うだけ言って引っ込んでしまった。\nだいぶチャキチャキ系の女将さんだな……）", "zh": "（说完就退回去了。\n真是个相当雷厉风行的老板娘啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "b650540b87835cf9de2855ee849aea74deee29197df4f94bf8a04d746c236d90", "ja": "あ、あの……っ！\nありさはエミリーちゃんの金髪、大好きです！", "zh": "啊，那个……！\n亚利沙最喜欢艾米莉的金发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "d092858970c5f58576a0aca28998063c6a3bc185c22ebe98e33af057f943af7a", "ja": "……？　はい、私も気に入っていますよ？", "zh": "……？是的，我也很喜欢哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "4c0e7781c0ff2238446f398e357074858e2b3a33fdf966dcc1ff1fb0b09e6066", "ja": "あ、あれ？\nそれなら、よかった……デス。", "zh": "啊，咦？\n这样的话，那就太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "e2b65b39ed5e1a5c466d3f07c09727c42a755b77c21652d47a62093a543ffb1a", "ja": "あ、もしかして……。\nふふっ、大丈夫です。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "啊，难道说……。\n呵呵，没事的。谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e2a752dec7ab4af22ad5e922f797c87679b7cea7ead78383bc6bfe15b8c530d4", "ja": "落ち込んでは、いないんだな。", "zh": "你没有闷闷不乐嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "68f4b32d2761cc53ceb4d238530e0fc9260dd2dd619cf5eb3d10fb3c3dac9cb7", "ja": "はい。女将さんの言っていることは\n正しいと思いますから。", "zh": "是的。我认为老板娘说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "0bc87f5ed204f72acbabb5de61b15184b6c9cd5143337709da269e1a3a25ba5c", "ja": "金髪に合う着物は限られることは、\n最初から、わかっていたんです。", "zh": "金发适合的和服很有限，这一点我从一开始就知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "a02326e9d3a309d3740246713388211f45f57bdba89dfe4dbee47073fb354736", "ja": "強いんですね、エミリーちゃんは……。", "zh": "艾米莉真坚强呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "90eac0b90fe485a7bee254f38354d5252c3e35ab42210471924d197a0f87c8e0", "ja": "とんでもありません。\nそんな立派なことではなくて……。", "zh": "没有的。\n并没有那么了不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "36a81267433d8dc617fe9c6a67992b147103b255ffc830e63ecc3c591570d60e", "ja": "こういうことは、よくあるんです。\n大和撫子になりたいと夢見た時から……。", "zh": "这种事情经常会发生。\n从梦想成为大和抚子那时起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "b9475663b86f21b966967bcab467cc21bc0063a8c9853442e6b225056569f1fa", "ja": "いえ、英国にいる頃、父から日本のことを\n伝え聞いていた頃からでしょうか。", "zh": "不，应该是从还在英国时，听父亲讲述日本的那些时候开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "52be775ff39a85824940cffd40eb60dd00b48405b64693fe009268bcc3e5342b", "ja": "英国とはまるで違う伝統と文化。手を伸ばしても、\n飛び込んでも、なかなか手が届かなくて……。", "zh": "与英国截然不同的传统与文化。即使伸出手去，即使纵身跃入，也总是难以触及……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9c68c76823d13fd5278608bb7949b1d15b6c2e350da0d25bb512fa40e49a00ce", "ja": "イギリスと日本じゃ、言葉も文化も考え方とかも、\nいろいろ違うからな。髪の色だけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "英国和日本在语言、文化、思维方式等方面都有许多不同。并不只是头发颜色不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "8b8f6713aa5fdf644f5616efbad5ac23dae7dea7afb393a6ac028dc14dff5a8f", "ja": "はい。かといって、生まれ育った\n英国が嫌いというわけではありません。", "zh": "是的。不过，我也不是讨厌自己出生并成长于其中的英国。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "1f039217fa9c23bf452325549c68d3dd73f52489b86fd13ca4185660c7973224", "ja": "無理に黒髪に染めようとは思いませんし、\n紅茶や、父や母のことも大好きです。", "zh": "我也没打算勉强把头发染成黑色，\n红茶，还有父亲和母亲，我都非常喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "f3c64f5911a12d9bd03e8af1c627dfdb10bf7d02e21a76fa3c86e5a60d2c7ca3", "ja": "英国での思い出も、日本への憧れも……\n私にはどちらも大切で、愛しいものです♪", "zh": "英国的回忆也好，对日本的憧憬也好……对我来说，两者都是珍贵而令人怜爱的事物♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "17b6b3249972a12abca848d8b659add992e1d2edfedc632f86d8aedeca526797", "ja": "どっちも大切で、愛しい……。", "zh": "两边都很重要，也都让我珍爱……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "a3d9e8a7e8dea27987cf5f81a83c144873472ed28ff3f4d7a4bf4b3002121ef1", "ja": "あ、もちろん、自分に都合のいいことばかり\n言っているとは思うのですが……。", "zh": "啊，我当然也觉得自己说的尽是对自己有利的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "1bbe8b95e734beb3d4ee7b0ab11f729d43392dc7e5a0095e53168b7f5c195457", "ja": "そ、そんなことは……！", "zh": "才、才不是那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1032_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1033_okamisan", "source_sha256": "0a063d0ec0566be86d0ca113707482ca34e7c777d631ba835174d1fb3d229bbd", "ja": "待たせたね。\n目録、持ってきたよ！", "zh": "久等了。\n我把目录拿来了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "86406fdb1303a40a6979efa3e37928fb3957eba23befc7325298b208be3d2167", "ja": "Wow！　きらびやかな振袖ばかり……！\n小紋ではなくて、いいんですか……？", "zh": "Wow！尽是些光彩夺目的振袖……！\n不是小纹也真的没关系吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_05_1035_okamisan", "source_sha256": "d3f1f8bdce6896f70fe1bb1013e22b7b5ad844a10334989c2b28ea67daed96fa", "ja": "ここまで来て半端な遠慮するもんじゃないよ！\n華の塊みたいなナリしてんだから、素直に振袖！", "zh": "都到这一步了，就别再顾虑什么了！\n你这副花团锦簇般的模样，就该老老实实穿振袖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
